Switchboard — Codex adapter

This package contains TypeScript type declarations generated by
`codex app-server generate-ts` from the OpenAI Codex CLI
(https://github.com/openai/codex), snapshot in src/generated/ (see the
README.md there for the exact version). Those files are:

